    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저는 향수를 만드는 조향사예요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800B2940020D5A5C218B97C0020B9CCB4DCB2940020C870D5A5C0ACC608C694002E001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬 슈쁘가 만들어 내는 향기로\n향수를 만들고 있죠.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAAC0020C288C058AC000020B9CCB4E4C5B40020B0B4B2940020D5A5AE30B85C000AD5A5C218B97C0020B9CCB4E4ACE00020C788C8E0002E001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "슈쁘는 먹은 먹이에 따라\n발산하는 향기가 바뀌게 돼요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C288C058B2940020BA39C7400020BA39C774C5D00020B530B77C000ABC1CC0B0D558B2940020D5A5AE30AC000020BC14B00CAC8C0020B3FCC694002E001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이번엔 슈쁘에게\n많은 양의 나무열매를 먹여 볼 생각이에요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774BC88C5D40020C288C058C5D0AC8C000AB9CEC7400020C591C7580020B098BB34C5F4B9E4B97C0020BA39C5EC0020BCFC0020C0DDAC01C774C5D0C6940021001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "현재 생각해 둔 조합은\n버치열매 20개,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n토망열매 5개,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n오카열매 5개예요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D604C7AC0020C0DDAC01D5740020B4540020C870D569C740000ABC84CE58C5F4B9E4002000320030AC1C002C00100001BE00000AD1A0B9DDC5F4B9E400200035AC1C002C00100001BE00000AC624CE74C5F4B9E400200035AC1CC608C694002E001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뿌?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BFCC003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그런데 여기엔\n곤란한 점이 하나 있어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7F0B3700020C5ECAE30C5D4000AACE4B780D55C0020C810C7740020D558B0980020C788C5B4C694002E001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "도시를 돌아다니며 다양한 냄새에 노출되면\n조합을 제대로 할 수 없다는 거예요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3C4C2DCB97C0020B3CCC544B2E4B2C8BA700020B2E4C591D55C0020B0C4C0C8C5D00020B178CD9CB418BA74000AC870D569C7440020C81CB300B85C0020D5600020C2180020C5C6B2E4B2940020AC70C608C694002E001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래서 저 대신\n나무열매를 준비해 주셨으면 해요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B798C11C0020C8000020B300C2E0000AB098BB34C5F4B9E4B97C0020C900BE44D5740020C8FCC168C73CBA740020D574C6940021001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나무열매들은 돌아다니며 모으셔도 되고,\n상점에서 구입해 오셔도 돼요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098BB34C5F4B9E4B4E4C7400020B3CCC544B2E4B2C8BA700020BAA8C73CC154B3C40020B418ACE0002C000AC0C1C810C5D0C11C0020AD6CC785D5740020C624C154B3C40020B3FCC6940021001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "버치열매 20개,\n토망열매 5개,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n오카열매 5개를 부탁드릴게요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC84CE58C5F4B9E4002000320030AC1C002C000AD1A0B9DDC5F4B9E400200035AC1C002C00100001BE00000AC624CE74C5F4B9E400200035AC1CB97C0020BD80D0C1B4DCB9B4AC8CC694002E001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
