      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "버치열매 20개,\n토망열매 5개,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n오카열매 5개를 가져오셨군요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC84CE58C5F4B9E4002000320030AC1C002C000AD1A0B9DDC5F4B9E400200035AC1C002C00100001BE00000AC624CE74C5F4B9E400200035AC1CB97C0020AC00C838C624C168AD70C6940021001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 정도로 많은 나무열매라면\n여러 향기가 뒤섞여서 복잡해지지 않을까요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020C815B3C4B85C0020B9CEC7400020B098BB34C5F4B9E4B77CBA74000AC5ECB7EC0020D5A5AE30AC000020B4A4C11EC5ECC11C0020BCF5C7A1D574C9C0C9C00020C54AC744AE4CC694003F001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "참고로 전달해 주신 나무열매는\n전부 매운맛이 나는 나무열매들이에요.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n이번에는 스파이시한 향수를 만들 거거든요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CC38ACE0B85C0020C804B2ECD5740020C8FCC2E00020B098BB34C5F4B9E4B294000AC804BD800020B9E4C6B4B9DBC7740020B098B2940020B098BB34C5F4B9E4B4E4C774C5D0C694002E00100001BE00000AC774BC88C5D0B2940020C2A4D30CC774C2DCD55C0020D5A5C218B97C0020B9CCB4E40020AC70AC70B4E0C694002E001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "슈뿌~!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C288BFCC007E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "슈쁘, 무슨 일이니?\n네가 화를 다 내고.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C288C058002C0020BB34C2A80020C77CC774B2C8003F000AB124AC000020D654B97C0020B2E40020B0B4ACE0002E001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "설마, 나무열매가 너무 많아서 그러니?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C124B9C8002C0020B098BB34C5F4B9E4AC000020B108BB340020B9CEC544C11C0020ADF8B7ECB2C8003F001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "슈뿌~",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C288BFCC007E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇지만 너도 네 몸에서\n어떤 새로운 향기가 날지 궁금하지 않니?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807C9C0B9CC0020B108B3C40020B1240020BAB8C5D0C11C000AC5B4B5A40020C0C8B85CC6B40020D5A5AE30AC000020B0A0C9C00020AD81AE08D558C9C00020C54AB2C8003F001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "슈뿌~",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C288BFCC007E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "알았어! 그럼, 많은 양의 나무열매를\n한 번에 섭취할 수 있는 방법을 찾아 볼게!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C54CC558C5B400210020ADF8B7FC002C0020B9CEC7400020C591C7580020B098BB34C5F4B9E4B97C000AD55C0020BC88C5D00020C12DCDE8D5600020C2180020C788B2940020BC29BC95C7440020CC3EC5440020BCFCAC8C0021001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르시티에서 사라진 과즙 가게...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B974C2DCD2F0C5D0C11C0020C0ACB77CC9C40020ACFCC9990020AC00AC8C002E002E002E001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그곳에서 일했던 사람을 찾아서\n버치열매를 레드쥬스로 만들면<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n슈쁘가 마실 수 있을 거야!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8ACF3C5D0C11C0020C77CD588B3580020C0ACB78CC7440020CC3EC544C11C000ABC84CE58C5F4B9E4B97C0020B808B4DCC96CC2A4B85C0020B9CCB4E4BA7400100001BE00000AC288C058AC000020B9C8C2E40020C2180020C788C7440020AC70C57C0021001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "슈뿌~!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C288BFCC007E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "덕분에 향수 제조의 가능성이\n더 무궁무진해졌어요!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n이건 답례로 드리는 거예요!\n조심민트와 경험사탕을 받아 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1980,
